🎓 Lessons Learned

Environment Variables Matter

Different files using different variable names caused issues
Solution: Standardized on PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY


Table Naming Confusion

Multiple tables with similar purposes (newsletter vs waitlist)
Solution: Clear documentation and careful checking


JavaScript Scope in Astro

Regular functions not accessible from inline HTML
Solution: Use window.functionName with is:inline script


Silent Failures

Tracking API returned 200 even when not saving
Good: Doesn't break popup
Bad: Harder to debug
Solution: Added extensive console warnings


Database Schema Evolution

Started with incomplete table structure
Solution: ALTER TABLE to add missing columns




